 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. A missing or unknown key
+returns `401 unauthorized`; insufficient permission returns `403 forbidden`.
+Viewers may use GET except `/audit`. Cooks may also cook recipes, record waste,
+log temperatures and enter stock-take counts. Managers may use all routes.
+Successful data-changing requests are audited with their time, key name, method,
+path (without query string), and response status. Seed keys are examples only.
+
+## Routes
+
+- `GET /audit`: audit entries, newest first; managers only.
+- `GET /items`, `GET /items/:id`, `GET /items/:id/best-price`.
+- `GET /batches`, `GET /batches/:id`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`.
+- `POST /orders`, `GET /orders/:id`, `POST /orders/:id/send`,
+  `POST /orders/:id/receive`, `POST /orders/:id/cancel`.
+- `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `GET /recipes/:id/cost`, `GET /recipes/:id/allergens`.
+- `GET /reports/stock-value`, `GET /reports/waste`, `GET /reports/margins`,
+  `GET /reports/allergens`, `GET /reports/temperatures`.
+- `GET /alerts`, `GET /suppliers`, `GET /suppliers/:id/prices`, `POST /prices`.
+- `GET /dishes`, `POST /dishes`, `GET /forecast/use/:itemId`, `GET /forecast/reorder`.
+- `GET /outbox`, `POST /outbox/:id/sent`, `POST /import/items`, `POST /jobs/nightly`.
+- `POST /stocktakes`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/finish`.
+- `PUT /items/:id/allergens`, `POST /temperatures`.
+- `GET /export/ledger.csv`, `GET /export/stock.csv`.
+
